      "created_at": "2014-02-07T17:39:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, the H mechanic is not needed in V5 games because it is automatically scaled via the number of villans to the number of heroes. &nbsp;Which means, if they add more villans in future expansion for this play mode, it might actually scale to 6 or more players.</p>",
