      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/skoticus/{size}/1964_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-02-11T23:20:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>As it is, I think the 6 could work right now: Use whatever villain you want with an H of 5, then add one of the V5 to make the H essentialy 6. I haven't tried this out yet, but I am thinking about trying it soon. I think it could also work for other numbers (5 heros: H=4 plus a V5; 4 heroes: H= 3 plus a V5; etc). Could be fun, especially for boosting some of the weaker villains that are often too easy.</p>",
